WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.819
Materialized-view freshness is easiest to understand
as a timeline The

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:12.931
snapshot is built Later a new base-table row arrives
The

00:00:12.958 --> 00:00:19.558
standard base query can see it immediately but the
materialized view does not After

00:00:19.571 --> 00:00:25.738
a refresh the stored snapshot catches up That delay
must be documented

00:00:25.764 --> 00:00:26.514
for users
